POST CONFIRMED: every counterexample the PRE reproduced is corrected. A mutated y changes the identity and a y-side target is a subject; the optimizer may only propose hyperparameters and the contract is re-derived before the pipeline; the review protocol has two real phases with a persisted submission; manifests, envelopes and producer artifacts enforce exact schemas and canonical digests; every outcome emits exactly one terminal carrying its own unit and cost; the loader is an ACTIVE supervised service that has carried a real run to the cube; the inventory versions instead of freezing; the code digest follows the real graph; the availability gap is bridged by evidence with zero as an honest answer; and the first characterization measures variables without choosing any.
